Subject: [PATCH 1/1] udma: add log function interfaces.

driver inclusion
category: feature
bugzilla: https://atomgit.com/openeuler/umdk/issues/887
CVE: NA

-----------------------------------------------------------

This patch add log function which could record log
in the container.

Signed-off-by: Wei Qin <qinwei61@huawei.com>
---
